/** 施工前後保存: スロット系以外（回転・フォルダ名・ファイル/フォルダ削除）。ファイルの親フォルダ移動は persistFilesDirtyCategoryMovesForBacmpSave で別送。 */
function collectBacmpSidecarBatchOperations() {
  const operations = []
  for (const [fileId, changes] of filesDirty.value.entries()) {
    if (String(fileId).startsWith('temp_')) continue
    if (changes?.rotation === undefined) continue
    operations.push({
      type: 'update',
      table: 'storage_metadata',
      id: fileId,
      data: { rotation: String(changes.rotation) }
    })
  }
  for (const [categoryId, changes] of categoriesDirty.value.entries()) {
    if (String(categoryId).startsWith('temp_')) continue
    if (changes?.label === undefined) continue
    operations.push({
      type: 'update',
      table: 'storage_metadata',
      id: categoryId,
      data: { name: changes.label }
    })
  }
  for (const fileId of deletedFiles.value) {
    if (String(fileId).startsWith('temp_')) continue
    operations.push({
      type: 'delete',
      table: 'storage_metadata',
      id: fileId
    })
  }
  for (const categoryId of deletedCategories.value) {
    if (String(categoryId).startsWith('temp_')) continue
    operations.push({
      type: 'delete',
      table: 'storage_metadata',
      id: categoryId
    })
  }
  return operations
}

function applyBacmpSidecarBatchClear(operations) {
  for (const op of operations) {
    if (op.type === 'update' && op.table === 'storage_metadata' && op.data) {
      const id = op.id
      if (op.data.rotation !== undefined) {
        const ch = filesDirty.value.get(id)
        if (!ch) continue
        const { rotation, ...rest } = ch
        if (Object.keys(rest).length === 0) filesDirty.value.delete(id)
        else filesDirty.value.set(id, rest)
      }
      if (op.data.name !== undefined) {
        categoriesDirty.value.delete(id)
      }
    }
    if (op.type === 'delete' && op.table === 'storage_metadata') {
      deletedFiles.value.delete(op.id)
      deletedCategories.value.delete(op.id)
    }
  }
}

